      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "5bc6fd601274c51b410266f1",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Quite often, especially during \"world-hopping\", users join their friends and then ask other people to join them or tell them they're going to send them an invite, but the problem is, it's not comfortable. And I do understand that bringing tons of people through a portal to those who wanted to remain in a private instance may be an issue, so I think dropping portals to invite-only instances may not be as good as in other cases, but there's got to be a faster way to join people in public and possibly friends+ instances as a group with the use of portals.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Portals to Friends",
