      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't know why this isn't now a thing with the new portal locking feature.\nTo elaborate on this request now: We should be able to drop portals to already-existing Friends or Friends+ worlds (that would be forced to be locked-only). The only people able to see the portal would be people under the rule set of the original instance creation.\nIf it was a friends only instance you and any friends of the instance owner would see the portal. If it's Friends+ then it would be visible to you, your friends, and any friends of people already in the instance.\nSo much easier than running around telling people, \"Hey join on me (or X person) in a minute\" and people trickling in.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
